    "updated_at": "2021-09-28T10:02:00Z",
    "body": "Can we consolidate with https://wicg.github.io/background-fetch/#extract-content-range-values-algorithm perhaps? (I realize there are delimiter differences, but perhaps they can be abstracted somehow. See also https://github.com/WICG/background-fetch/issues/157.)\r\n\r\nThe other thing that might help is to use isomorphic decode, so you can operate on a string. That removes the need for state and allows for using Infra's \"collect a sequence\" algorithms.",
