    "body": "@annevk I'm not sure how useful it is to consolidate with `Content-Range`, since the format is pretty different.\r\n\r\n- `^bytes \\d+-\\d+/(\\*|\\d+)$` - simple `Content-Range`\r\n- `^bytes=\\d+-\\d*$` - simple `Range`\r\n\r\nI think it'd be confusing to try and combine the two.\r\n\r\nI'll look at defining this using \"collect a sequence\", or would you rather I used the [ABNF style from background-fetch](https://wicg.github.io/background-fetch/#single-byte-content-range)?",
